                        "text": "<ul><li><strong>Bio-Motion Recognition</strong><br/>Clips easily to arms, wrists, ankles, or socks to highlight natural movement patterns.</li><li><strong>180° Brightness</strong><br/>Three red LEDs provide wide-angle visibility from all directions.</li><li><strong>Ultra-Light Design</strong><br/>Weighs just 1/2 oz—barely noticeable when worn.</li><li><strong>Water-Resistant Build</strong><br/>Engineered to handle various weather and outdoor conditions.</li><li><strong>Three Light Modes</strong><br/>Choose from solid, quick flash, or slow flash depending on your needs.</li><li><strong>Highly Versatile</strong><br/>Works as a rear bike light, dog light, taillight, or night running safety flasher.</li><li><strong>Long-Lasting Power</strong><br/>Comes with two CR2032 batteries (installed) lasting ~50 hours.</li><li><strong>Tool Included</strong><br/>Includes small screwdriver for easy battery replacement.</li></ul>",
